      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Mic loopback test button on audio settings screen. every other platform has it, but if vrchat had it, i would not need a friend to record and send me samples of my voice so i can tune myself to be a bit louder and less bassy (with 3rd party software).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-09-27T16:59:57.140Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It is a persistent problem that every few updates I will have people mute me because my microphone is too loud. However, I have no idea what they're hearing because I have no way to hear myself. As such, it would be nice to have some sort of an in-game microphone test/monitor button that will allow me to hear myself as I sound to others. This would go a long way in making the process of setting my microphone volume a more exact science instead of a guessing game.",
